@flexiarg operator/change-the-spec-by-addition-and-discuss-rewrites
@title Change The Specification By Addition, And Discuss Before Rewriting
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-Ajj6jr turn-Rpxwc0
@parent operator/grant-the-legitimate-part-then-reject-the-rest
@context Repair work may need the formal specification to change.

! conclusion: Add what is needed, keep the old text, and bring any rewrite to the operator before doing it.

  + IF:
    The operator allows changes but says they should mostly be additions, and that rewrites are discussed first.

  + HOWEVER:
    An addition can contradict the rest and the agent may call a rewrite an addition.

  + THEN:
    Add what is needed, keep the old text, and bring any rewrite to the operator before doing it.

  + BECAUSE:
    A rewrite loses the reference the code is checked against.
